This licence covers the Patchwork dataset: the assembled advisory metadata,
the model-generated analyses, and the agreement/adjudication labels.

It does NOT cover the source code of the analysed repositories. The dataset ships
commit pointers, content hashes and minimal excerpts; any code you reconstruct with
fetch_full.py remains under its originating repository's own licence.

Advisory metadata derives from OSV and GitHub Security Advisories (CC BY 4.0) and
the National Vulnerability Database (public domain).

Analyses were produced with Google Gemini via Vertex AI. Google's Service Specific
Terms restrict using model output to create or improve models similar to a Google
model; that restriction is passed through to users of this dataset.
